{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>For I know his inclination, which he is doing today.</b> That they do not look forward to entering the land in order to serve Me in it as is intended by Me, as it says: וַיִּתֵּן לָהֶם אַרְצוֹת גּוֹיִם, בַּעֲבוּר יִשְׁמְרוּ חֻקָּיו (Psalms 105:44–45). Rather, they look forward to it to satisfy their craving soul, and from this all the evil that was prophesied will follow, as it says: וַיִּשְׁמַן יְשֻׁרוּן וַיִּבְעָט (Deuteronomy 32:15)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:22:48.912725427Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}